# CR 605.3, 602.2a: a mana ability is activated by the rules for any activated ability, so one activated from a hidden zone
# reveals the card that has it, before its cost is paid. Elvish Spirit Guide's "Exile this card from your hand: Add {G}"
# reveals it, then exiles it: Bot1 has revealed it once, the {G} is in its pool, and it pays for Llanowar Elves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Elvish Spirit Guide
Llanowar Elves
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
[Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Revealed = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Spirit Guide.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
? Bot1.Revealed = Elvish Spirit Guide
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast

[Expect]
Exile = Elvish Spirit Guide
Bot1.Battlefield = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Revealed = Elvish Spirit Guide
Bot2.Revealed = (absent)
